#chip 18F4550, 20

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Wait 3 10ms (tens of milliseconds) in a 100 ms loop
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 500,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit

Repeat for 100 ms
    Wait 3 10ms
    PORTA = !PORTA
End Repeat
Do
Loop
